# Tracking & Notifications Rule (@tracking-and-notifications.mdc)

## 1) Purpose & Scope
- Define the tracking lifecycle, events taxonomy, UI/UX specs for timeline, badges, and notifications.
- Phase 1 is UI-only: static/mocked data, no backend calls, no Shopify features.
- Stack: Next.js 14+ (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui.
- Enforce naming/ID scoping and icon usage rules [[@naming-and-scoping.mdc]][[lucide-kebab-case-icon-structure.mdc]].

---

## 2) Shipment Status Model (Single Active State)
- Statuses:
  - LabelCreated
  - DropoffConfirmed
  - ReceivedAtFacility
  - InTransit
  - OutForDelivery
  - DeliveryAttempted
  - Delivered
  - FailedDelivery
  - ReturnedToSender
  - Cancelled
- Allowed transitions:
  - LabelCreated → DropoffConfirmed | Cancelled
  - DropoffConfirmed → ReceivedAtFacility
  - ReceivedAtFacility → InTransit
  - InTransit → OutForDelivery | ReturnedToSender
  - OutForDelivery → Delivered | DeliveryAttempted | FailedDelivery
  - DeliveryAttempted → OutForDelivery | FailedDelivery
  - FailedDelivery → ReturnedToSender | OutForDelivery
  - ReturnedToSender → Cancelled
- Badge color mapping (Tailwind):
  - LabelCreated: slate
  - DropoffConfirmed: indigo
  - ReceivedAtFacility: violet
  - InTransit: blue
  - OutForDelivery: amber
  - DeliveryAttempted: orange
  - Delivered: green
  - FailedDelivery: red
  - ReturnedToSender: rose
  - Cancelled: gray

---

## 3) Event Taxonomy (Append-only Timeline)
- Types:
  - LABEL_CREATED
  - DROP_OFF_CONFIRMED
  - SCANNED_AT_FACILITY
  - IN_TRANSIT_DEPARTED
  - IN_TRANSIT_ARRIVED
  - OUT_FOR_DELIVERY
  - DELIVERY_ATTEMPTED
  - DELIVERY_FAILED
  - DELIVERED
  - RETURNED_TO_SENDER
  - POD_UPLOADED (photo/signature)
  - NOTE_ADDED (internal/merchant-visible)
- Event object (UI contract):
  - id (uuid), timestamp (ISO), type (string), statusAfter (ShipmentStatus)
  - location (string), coordinates? { lat: number; lng: number }
  - actor: 'system' | 'courier' | 'merchant'
  - details? (string)
  - attachments?: Array<{ url: string; type: 'photo' | 'signature' | 'doc' }>
  - meta?: Record<string, unknown>

---

## 4) Identifiers & Formats (Mock)
- Tracking number: `ASH-YYYYMMDD-XXXXXX` (X = alphanumeric).
- Barcode: Code128 of the tracking string (UI mock).
- Courier scan payload (mock): { trackingNumber, scannedAt, scanType: 'DROP_OFF'|'FACILITY_IN'|'FACILITY_OUT'|'POD', coordinates? }

---

## 5) UI Components & IDs (shadcn/ui + Tailwind)
- Tracking Widget (Dashboard)
  - Elements: input, submit button, compact result card with current status and link to full page.
  - IDs:
    - `parcego-tracking-widget-input`
    - `parcego-tracking-widget-submit-btn`
    - `parcego-tracking-widget-result-card`
- Full Tracking Page
  - Sections:
    - Header: tracking number, current status badge, last update
    - Timeline: vertical, newest first
    - Shipment Summary: origin, destination, ETA (mock), carrier (mock)
    - Proof of Delivery gallery: thumbnails + modal preview
  - IDs:
    - `parcego-tracking-header`
    - `parcego-tracking-status-badge`
    - `parcego-tracking-timeline`
    - `parcego-tracking-summary-card`
    - `parcego-tracking-pod-gallery`
- Notifications Center (Dashboard)
  - Elements: unread filter, list, mark-as-read, clear-all (UI-only)
  - IDs:
    - `parcego-notif-center`
    - `parcego-notif-item-{uuid}`
    - `parcego-notif-mark-read-btn`
    - `parcego-notif-clear-all-btn`
- Icons (global rule):
  - Must use `<span>` with `class="iconify lucide-icon"`, `data-icon="lucide:..."`, inline style for size/color. Do not use Lucide React components directly [[lucide-kebab-case-icon-structure.mdc]].

---

## 6) Notification Channels, Triggers, Preferences (UI-only)
- Channels: 'in-app' (required), 'email' (mock), 'sms' (mock), 'push' (mock).
- Default triggers:
  - LABEL_CREATED: in-app
  - DROP_OFF_CONFIRMED: in-app, email
  - RECEIVED_AT_FACILITY: in-app
  - IN_TRANSIT_*: in-app
  - OUT_FOR_DELIVERY: in-app, sms
  - DELIVERY_ATTEMPTED: in-app, email
  - DELIVERED: in-app, email, sms
  - DELIVERY_FAILED: in-app, email, sms
  - RETURNED_TO_SENDER: in-app, email
  - POD_UPLOADED: in-app
- Dedup & quiet hours (mock policy):
  - Coalesce identical events within 2 minutes per channel
  - Max 3 SMS per shipment per day
  - Quiet hours 21:00–07:00 local defer non-critical SMS/Email (in-app unaffected)
- User preferences (per-merchant, UI state only):
  - Opt-in/out per channel and trigger, quiet hours, locale/time zone.

---

## 7) Accessibility & Motion
- Keyboard operable inputs/buttons; use `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby`.
- Live regions: announce current status updates via `role="status"` and `aria-live="polite"`.
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`: reduce to opacity-only.
- Hover/active transitions:
  - Use `transition-all` with shared CSS variables.
  - Avoid default `transform: translateY(-2px)` on hover across the project.
  - Active state may use `scale-95` for tactile feedback; avoid vertical shift.

---

## 8) Premium Transitions (Consistent)
- Global CSS variables (in `globals.css`):
  - `--transition-quick: 150ms;`
  - `--transition-normal: 250ms;`
  - `--transition-slow: 350ms;`
  - `--easing-smooth: cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);`
  - `--easing-premium: cubic-bezier(0.165, 0.84, 0.44, 1);`
- Patterns:
  - Cards/Buttons: subtle hover shadow/color; `active:scale-95`
  - Timeline entrance: fade + slide with stagger; disable when reduced motion
  - Modals (POD preview): opacity + scale

---

## 9) Naming & Scoping (IDs/classes)
- IDs must be globally unique: `parcego-[component]-[purpose]-[unique]`
  - Examples: `parcego-tracking-widget-input`, `parcego-tracking-timeline-item-abc123`
- Classes follow BEM-like pattern when custom class needed: `parcego-block__element--modifier`
- Append UUIDs to IDs for dynamic lists.
- Validate uniqueness via linting and reviews [[@naming-and-scoping.mdc]].

---

## 10) Data Contracts (TypeScript, UI-only)
```ts
export type ShipmentStatus =
  | 'LabelCreated'
  | 'DropoffConfirmed'
  | 'ReceivedAtFacility'
  | 'InTransit'
  | 'OutForDelivery'
  | 'DeliveryAttempted'
  | 'Delivered'
  | 'FailedDelivery'
  | 'ReturnedToSender'
  | 'Cancelled';

export type TrackingEvent = {
  id: string;
  timestamp: string; // ISO
  type: string;
  statusAfter: ShipmentStatus;
  location?: string;
  coordinates?: { lat: number; lng: number };
  actor: 'system' | 'courier' | 'merchant';
  details?: string;
  attachments?: Array<{ url: string; type: 'photo' | 'signature' | 'doc' }>;
  meta?: Record<string, unknown>;
};

export type NotificationChannel = 'in-app' | 'email' | 'sms' | 'push';

export type Notification = {
  id: string;
  createdAt: string; // ISO
  channel: NotificationChannel;
  title: string;
  body: string;
  importance: 'low' | 'normal' | 'high';
  relatedTrackingNumber?: string;
  read: boolean;
  actions?: Array<{ label: string; action: 'view' | 'dismiss' }>;
};

export type ShipmentSummary = {
  trackingNumber: string;
  status: ShipmentStatus;
  origin: string;
  destination: string;
  eta?: string;
  carrier?: string;
  lastUpdate: string;
  hasPOD: boolean;
};
```

---

## 11) UI Behaviors
- Tracking Widget:
  - Validate format; inline error on invalid pattern.
  - On submit route to: `/track-package?tracking={trackingNumber}`.
  - Optional skeleton before showing mock result.
- Timeline:
  - Render newest first; collapse older events behind “Show older updates”.
  - Each item: icon, title, timestamp (TZ-aware), location, details, attachments.
- POD Gallery:
  - Thumbnails open keyboard-accessible modal; ESC to close; focus trap.
- Notifications Center:
  - Newest first; unread emphasized; “Mark all as read” updates local state only.
  - Optional toasts respect reduced motion.

---

## 12) Navigation (App Router)
- Dashboard widget → `/track-package?tracking={trackingNumber}`
- Courier mock flows (as already present):
  - `/courier/scan`, `/courier/proof`, `/courier/route`
- Do not add any Shopify routes in this phase.

---

## 13) Copy & Localization
- English defaults; format times for user locale/time zone when available, else UTC.
- Status titles in sentence case; concise, action-oriented notifications.

---

## 14) Error & Empty States (UI-only)
- Invalid tracking:
  - Inline error in widget; no navigation.
- No events yet:
  - Friendly placeholder with guidance and CTA.
- Missing POD:
  - Hide gallery, show “No proof of delivery available yet”.

---

## 15) Privacy (UI-only)
- Do not render PII beyond shipment summary.
- Mask phone/email in notification previews where relevant.

---

## 16) Admin & Audit (UI-only)
- Internal notes flagged “Internal” in timeline.
- Optional audit panel: collapsible raw JSON of events for debug.

---

## 17) QA Checklist
- Keyboard navigation for all controls.
- Screen reader live-announces status changes.
- Reduced motion respected; no layout shifts.
- Unique `parcego-` IDs; accessible color contrast.
- No default translateY(-2px) hover effect.
- No Shopify artifacts.
